            "block_content": "(a) Union dues or service fees deductions shall be suspended during periods of leave-of-absence or layoff. When the employee is returned to the payroll in a regular status, deduction of Union dues or service fees shall be resumed automatically except in instances of military leave or exhausted recall rights.",
