        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 17.5.1. The Union will be allowed a fair amount of time during the new hire orientation to present applicable Union issues. The hiring department is responsible for notifying the Union office not less than one week before the orientation session. Membership in the Union is not compulsory. Employees in job classifications included in the Bargaining Unit are free to accept or decline membership in the Union.",
